  "briefing": "Meridian Combine holds Sumatra through its signal tower. Reconnect 2 relays, hold the uplink while it broadcasts, unlock the service gate, then leave by the exit. Expect 12 enemy agents and 5 guards on the streets.",
  "story": "Sumatra Uplink: Meridian Combine runs Sumatra from its signal tower, and the district only notices when the lights go out. Your team has one night to reconnect the relays, hold the uplink and walk out the exit.",
